## 3. Diagnosis that redirected the method (12 October 2026)

The task assumed the missing low end was thin kick and tom bodies. Measured on V_034: the reference drums stem carries a continuous bed of 20 to 30 dB in every third-octave band from 30 to 500 Hz in every frame, between hits as much as on them (Demucs bleed or room), while our render is nearly empty there outside the kick sine. Per-hit bodies therefore fill only part of it (+1.0 point), and a low bed fitted per eighth note fills the rest. After bodies, gap blocks and bed, the residual turned into extra energy (V_014: +1.1 dB at 120 to 500 Hz), which the segment EQ removes. (12 October 2026)

